Every stage must preserve the source and version of its data.

Every stage must handle failure without corrupting completed work.

Every status must mean one clear thing.

Every count must identify what is being counted.

Every assessment must preserve uncertainty.

Every action must be authorized.

Every important decision must be auditable.

Every map marker must link to the correct report or physical issue.

Every heatmap cell must be reproducible from the records it summarizes.

Every dashboard metric must use the same definition wherever it appears.

Every integration must be tested rather than merely described.

**Do not build four prompts' worth of disconnected features. Build one connected UrbanPulse platform.**

